## 1 · The business notices first

Open the deployment's Companion App, then its **Lending Analytics** route (local fallback: http://127.0.0.1:8000/analytics). Point to one disputed rejection and the associated lending impact, or start directly with the recorded rejection below. Do not spend the opening touring the whole dashboard.

