The completed ordinary Depot deployment uses **v0.8.0** in Langfuse Cloud **v4.64.0**, project [ev-demo-delivery-20261019](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cmvfnhw3l00cyad0miroa0t9k). This reference project now has **production v2** and a nine-item comparison. These are recorded rehearsal results; use this deployment's links and saved policy for new actions. Do not reset the reference project's label or duplicate its curated item.

- **Halo:** a neutral investigation found the missing binding and cited retrieval, the correct affordability calculation and the incomplete generation input. Halo added one reviewed source item to the existing eight-item cohort and read back all fields. This proves curation into an existing dataset, not new-dataset creation in this project.
- **Playground:** five valid pairs returned baseline grant €0 / principal €45,000 / reject and candidate grant €6,000 / principal €39,000 / approve. The screenshot shows editable copies of the templates. Two earlier empty-object outputs were schema-setup failures and are retained in the record.
- **[Native experiment comparison](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cmvfnhw3l00cyad0miroa0t9k/experiments/results?baseline=cmvfnu53u00dgad0elletj4pa&c=cmvfnvpen00qgad0e9zbn9txv):** fixed managed v1 **4/9** versus v2 **9/9**, all 18 automatic policy scores independently checked; dataset version **2026-10-19T19:39:47.535Z**. Both used Sonnet 4.6, 512 output tokens, temperature omitted and the same six-field schema. This targeted cohort is not a population accuracy estimate. The comparison's directional badge is from the baseline perspective; show the actual false→true rows and 44% versus 100% values.
- **Live monitoring:** [baseline](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cmvfnhw3l00cyad0miroa0t9k/traces/6d8c422e2d7ddce0096749792540acd8) v1 false; [eligible candidate](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cmvfnhw3l00cyad0miroa0t9k/traces/746ebc299397a2baa46fbcf0159979c8?observation=c23d424c60f60cff) v2 true; [PHEV control](https://cloud.langfuse.com/project/cmvfnhw3l00cyad0miroa0t9k/traces/66f60d4cea7517a9bef519632a8859e6) v2 true. Each has four observations, one model generation/usage record and one automatic score on the agent, without review feedback.

